{"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"OUDSTextArea","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents12OUDSTextAreaV"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextarea"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Helperlink"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/init(label:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/HelperText","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Status"],"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/View-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTextArea","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text area is based on several configurable UI elements:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"label","type":"text"}]},{"text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the text area.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the text area is part of a compact layout, the label can be hidden.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"placeholder","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the text of the text area is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Status","anchor":"Status","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enabled (by default)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"error","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"error"},{"type":"text","text":" status indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the text area. The error message replaces the helper text.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"loading","type":"text"}]},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"loading","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The field remains editable while loading.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"readOnly","type":"text"}]},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"readOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" status lets the text visible but not editable."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}]},{"text":": In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"disabled"},{"type":"text","text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Note the SwiftUI "},{"code":"View.disabled()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper text (plain)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A supporting text conveys additional information about the text area,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text (characters max count)"}]},{"text":": Uses an internal message displaying the count of remaining characters depending to the given value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is a specific iOS library feature with 1.4.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper link"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal)."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"However you should think about cases where you will have to make the devices vibrate."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Mandatory field indication","level":2,"anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your formular.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your formular."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"bold font weight"}]},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"negative content color","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (red on light backgrounds).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If there is only one field in the formular, or if the mandatory nature is obvious,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the formular’s functionality.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Outlined style","anchor":"Outlined-style","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area uses a subtle background fill and a bottom border only, creating a softer and more contained look."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"outlined"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", the text area uses a transparent background and a visible stroke on all four sides."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This style may be appropriate for contexts where inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"for example inside a card, a dialog, or a filtering panel."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ An outlined text area","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Fixed height","level":2,"anchor":"Fixed-height","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area grows vertically as the user types, up to a maximum height defined by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"design system (token "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeMaxHeightInput"},{"type":"text","text":"). Once that height is reached, the content becomes scrollable."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"constrainedMaxHeight","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is set to ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the maximum height is capped to the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"minimum"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" height","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeMinHeightInput"},{"text":"), keeping the component at a fixed, compact size at all times.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The content is immediately scrollable from the first overflow line.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is useful in dense layouts — forms, filter panels, chat composers — where vertical space is at a premium."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Height is fixed to the minimum (no vertical growth)","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"]},{"text":"Rich text","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Rich-text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\")","","    \/\/ With a plain helper text","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\",","                 helperText: .plain(\"Maximum 500 characters.\"))","","    \/\/ With a maximum character count — the component shows \"X characters remaining\" (bold)","    \/\/ and switches to an error style when exceeded.","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 helperText: .charactersMaxCount(500))","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = OUDSTextArea.Helperlink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)","","    \/\/ With error status","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, status: .error(message: \"This field can't be empty.\"))","","    \/\/ Outlined style","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","    \/\/ Fixed height — no vertical growth","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Design documentation","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-text-area","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading"},{"text":"Orange","level":3,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_textArea_Orange","type":"image"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_OrangeCompact"}]},{"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_textArea_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_Wireframe"}]},{"name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.1 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"},{"name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.4.0","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Text area is a UI element that allows to type, edit, or select longer blocks of textual data, such as comments, messages or descriptions;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by expanding vertically and offering more space to input text."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for multiline text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, descriptions, and validation feedback."}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTextArea/Status":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Status","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Status","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Define all available status for the text area"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextarea\/status","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSTextArea.Status","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Status"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTextArea/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:co